        "body": "Georgia received $73.3M in federal contract obligations in FY2027 to date. The state recorded 1,679 awards with an average award size of $43.6K. Obligations are down 99.3% year over year. Historical full-year totals were larger, with FY26 at $9.9B and FY25 at $11.7B."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the top buyers, vendors, and industries in Georgia now?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs obligated $59.2M, followed by the Department of Justice with $11.7M and the Department of Agriculture with $2.3M. TECHANAX LLC received $7.6M, FLIGHTWORKS INC received $4.7M, and VETMED GROUP LLC received $4.7M. Temporary Help Services led industries with $12.2M, Ambulance Services followed with $9.4M, and Other Computer Related Services had $8.1M."
      }
